{"hw":"τιμέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">τιμέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">τιμ-έω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dor.</span> </span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = τιμάω, prob. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5(1).962.39</span> </span> (Cotyrta, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii B.C.</span>); <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">τιμεῖν</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.952.16</span> </span> (Acragas, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B.C.</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5(1).1432.41</span> </span> (Messene); <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span>fem. <span class=\"gk\">τιμίονσα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">GDI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5150.22</span> </span> (Crete, found at Delos, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii B.C.</span>); masc. pl. <span class=\"gk\">τιμέοντες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">637.6</span> </span> (Delph., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii B.C.</span>):—in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.39</span> </span> all codd. have <span class=\"gk\">ἐπι-τιμέων</span>; similar forms in the Ionic writings of <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Dom.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Astr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span>).</div></div>"}